            <div xml:id="d41">

                <pb facs="0145" n="35" sameAs="frus:frus1928v03/pg35"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">868.51 Struma Valley/9: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Greece</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Skinner</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Athens</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-04-26T19:00:00+02:00"><hi rendition="#italic">April 26,
                                1928—7 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received April 26—3:30
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>32. My telegram number 27, April 23, noon. Minister for Foreign Affairs desires
                    me to state in writing that Foundation Company (Foreign) is an American concern.
                    What answer am I authorized to make?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Skinner</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
